Package: quadcopula
Type: Package
Title: Binary Quadratic Copula Models
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Tarik Bahraoui
Maintainer: Tarik Bahraoui <bahraoui@example.com>
Description: Implements binary quadratic copula models for high-dimensional binary 
    data with complex nonlinear dependence structures. Provides estimation via 
    penalized pseudolikelihood, bootstrap inference, goodness-of-fit testing, 
    and power analysis. Applications to genomic data including gene expression 
    and single-cell RNA sequencing with biological validation.
License: MIT
